Subject: [PATCH 4/9] WIP: check-deps holds dbus to the engine; BUILDING.md for
 the SDK image, releases and interop

Only sukkula-engine may use the dbus crate and only dbus may use
libdbus-sys: clippy.toml's constructor bans reach our crates, not a
dependency that opens a connection itself. BUILDING.md documents the
digest-pinned SDK image and who can publish it, the release ancestry
check and the tag ruleset it cannot replace, the wormhole-interop job,
and the missing Quick Share reference-client test.

